{"grammar":[{"label":"Informs","destination":"Question","source":"Evidence"},{"label":"Supports","destination":"Claim","source":"Evidence"},{"label":"Supports","destination":"Claim","source":"Evidence"},{"label":"Opposes","destination":"Claim","source":"Evidence"},{"label":"Informed By","destination":"Hypothesis","source":"Issue"},{"label":"Informed By","destination":"Hypothesis","source":"Issue"},{"label":"Supports","destination":"Conclusion","source":"Result"},{"label":"Opposes","destination":"Conclusion","source":"Result"},{"label":"Informs","destination":"Question","source":"Result"},{"label":"Informs","destination":"Hypothesis","source":"Evidence"},{"label":"Supports","destination":"Hypothesis","source":"Evidence"},{"label":"Supports","destination":"Hypothesis","source":"Evidence"},{"label":"Opposes","destination":"Hypothesis","source":"Evidence"},{"label":"Informed By","destination":"Question","source":"Hypothesis"},{"label":"Informs","destination":"Question","source":"Claim"},{"label":"Reproduces","destination":"Evidence","source":"Evidence"},{"label":"Reproduces","destination":"Evidence","source":"Evidence"},{"label":"Supports","destination":"Hypothesis","source":"Result"},{"label":"Supports","destination":"Hypothesis","source":"Result"},{"label":"Opposes","destination":"Hypothesis","source":"Result"}],"nodes":[{"uid":"doLu5PTIu","title":"[[CLM]] - Cheetahs are the fastest land animal","children":[{"text":"Source of Claim","open":true,"order":0,"uid":"0XcCTBfgE","heading":2,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:54:24.600Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[],"parents":[]},{"text":"Notes","open":true,"order":1,"uid":"XRW8dMSMw","heading":2,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:54:24.605Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[],"parents":[]}],"date":"2023-05-29T21:54:24.227Z","createdBy":"Matt Akamatsu"},{"uid":"cyQikwNB-","title":"[[QUE]] - What is the fastest land animal?","children":[{"text":"Summary ","open":true,"order":0,"uid":"R9hYT9p5-","heading":2,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:41:16.071Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[{"text":"Given that [[[[EVD]] - A cheetah chased a Jeep at a speed of 63.8 ± 1.5 mph - [[@sharp1997timed]]]], and no other land animal has reliably been measured to run >55 mph ([[@sharp1997timed]]), we think that [[[[CLM]] - Cheetahs are the fastest land animal]]","open":true,"order":0,"uid":"1Nfpr6nxz","heading":0,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-06-30T22:24:26.656Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[],"parents":[0]}],"parents":[]},{"text":"Workbench","open":true,"order":1,"uid":"jsFtwcg-z","heading":2,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:41:16.076Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[{"text":"Papers to look through","open":true,"order":0,"uid":"t1yRztrqM","heading":3,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:41:16.080Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[{"text":"[[@sharp1997timed]]","open":true,"order":0,"uid":"GpmBEIdWy","heading":0,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-06-01T21:14:10.341Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[],"parents":[0,0]}],"parents":[0]},{"text":"Notes","open":false,"order":1,"uid":"jBM6BeC0E","heading":3,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:41:16.084Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[{"text":"[[[[CLM]] - Cheetahs are the fastest land animal]]","open":true,"order":0,"uid":"UDmMLc5iK","heading":0,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-06-30T22:24:26.656Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[{"text":"[[SupportedBy]]","open":true,"order":0,"uid":"tcGBvtY0J","heading":0,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:56:09.052Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[{"text":"[[[[EVD]] - A cheetah chased a Jeep at a speed of 63.8 ± 1.5 mph - [[@sharp1997timed]]]]","open":true,"order":0,"uid":"ue-jJAVTh","heading":0,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:56:13.664Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[],"parents":[0,0]}],"parents":[0,0]}],"parents":[0,0]}],"parents":[0]}],"parents":[]},{"text":"Testable hypotheses","open":false,"order":2,"uid":"6d2_3jkLM","heading":2,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:41:16.091Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[],"parents":[]}],"date":"2023-05-29T21:41:15.725Z","createdBy":"Matt Akamatsu"},{"uid":"R-0nDgJJ8","title":"[[EVD]] - A cheetah chased a Jeep at a speed of 63.8 ± 1.5 mph - [[@sharp1997timed]]","children":[{"text":"Evidence Statement ((single sentence that can be interpreted in a standalone way))","open":true,"order":0,"uid":"JvOZcyv8t","heading":2,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:42:55.945Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[],"parents":[]},{"text":"Snippets ((from the paper that can be summarized into the evidence description, each with page it’s from (optional) ))","open":true,"order":1,"uid":"ThF86-Bz3","heading":2,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:42:55.955Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[{"text":"![](https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/firescript-577a2.appspot.com/o/imgs%2Fapp%2Fakamatsulab%2F_5OLQLAQop.png?alt=media&token=b372aaf8-f1a9-46ee-be3d-5f9267e2e69d)","open":true,"order":0,"uid":"luxfNaa0q","heading":0,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:46:05.133Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[],"parents":[0]}],"parents":[]},{"text":"Grounding Context ((What extra info puts this observation in context?))","open":true,"order":2,"uid":"2Fr5d1eeC","heading":2,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:42:55.958Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[{"text":"![](https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/firescript-577a2.appspot.com/o/imgs%2Fapp%2Fakamatsulab%2FmVo7U3yVY0.png?alt=media&token=56388131-7982-498e-843b-5b37e74ee6db)","open":true,"order":0,"uid":"hUhIfDWfc","heading":0,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:52:49.592Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[],"parents":[0]},{"text":"Methods text","open":false,"order":1,"uid":"cXn8yf702","heading":0,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:54:42.143Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[{"text":"> The subject was an adult female cheetah weighing approximately 35 kg, which had been orphaned as a cub, and reared on Kenplains Farm, Athi River, Kenya, by Dr David Hopcraft. She was returned to the wild, but visited Kenplains occasionally. The measurements were made on one of these visits, between 10:OO h and 11 :30 h, on firm  level ground with a slight covering of murram dust. There was insufficient wind to move wool hanging vertically from a post. ","open":true,"order":0,"uid":"ae06I33oa","heading":0,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:44:02.775Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[],"parents":[0]},{"text":"> A 220 yard (201.2 m) course was measured, with a surveyor’s tape, and marked with 2 posts at each end. The posts at the start had a taut length of white wool tied between them, approximately 0.45 m from the ground. A clear line was drawn between the posts at the finish. ","open":true,"order":1,"uid":"FiNIFkG-u","heading":0,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:44:12.199Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[],"parents":[0]},{"text":"> The author, who undertook  the timing, was then a  current athletics coach well used to hand-timing. He used an analogue stopwatch (Omega), reading to 0.1 s, which had been calibrated against 2 stopwatches in The Voice of Kenya broadcasting house, and 2 stopwatches of the Kenya Amateur Athletics Association. ","open":true,"order":2,"uid":"XDFC2zIHV","heading":0,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:44:18.004Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[],"parents":[0]},{"text":"> Each trial was started with the cheetah held 18m behind the start line. ^^A running start was decided upon^^ as hunting cheetah  launch into their major  sprint from a moving start, and sustained maximum running speed over a reasonable distance was the desired parameter. An open Landrover stood, with engine running, about 75 m down the course. ^^The stopwatch operator stood in the back of the Landrover holding a piece of meat which had been shown to the cheetah.^^ On a command, the cheetah was released, and when the timer saw her break the wool at the start he activated the stopwatch. The Landrover accelerated down the course and stopped after the finish line,  when the meat was thrown down. ^^The watch was stopped at the instant when the cheetah’s anterior thorax was deemed to have crossed the finish line.^^","open":true,"order":3,"uid":"TPQ7WgGc3","heading":0,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:45:41.377Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[],"parents":[0]}],"parents":[0]}],"parents":[]},{"text":"How central is this evidence to the claim at hand?","open":true,"order":3,"uid":"ZfT-y6T4f","heading":2,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:42:55.962Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[{"text":"{{[[slider]]}}","open":true,"order":0,"uid":"6-StqFwwb","heading":0,"viewType":"bullet","editTime":"2023-05-29T21:42:55.966Z","props":{"imageResize":{},"iframe":{}},"textAlign":"left","children":[],"parents":[0]}],"parents":[]}],"date":"2023-05-29T21:42:55.586Z","createdBy":"Matt Akamatsu"}],"relations":[{"label":"Informs","source":"R-0nDgJJ8","target":"cyQikwNB-"},{"label":"Supports","source":"R-0nDgJJ8","target":"doLu5PTIu"}]}